@startuml
title Pipeline B: UDVD → AtomSegNet → mask → lattice

participant "1742_udvd_incnb_jpg/*.jpg" as UDVD
participant "atomsegnet_udvd_results_full" as ResB
participant "blured_udvd_sigma14\n+ atom_cluster_out_udvd_sigma14_full" as MaskB
participant "atomsegnet_udvd_results_full\n(lattice_filled2/3/dense)" as GeoB

' UDVD denoise is produced externally → 1742_udvd_incnb_jpg

UDVD -> ResB: batch_run_atomsegnet.py\n(model=Gen1-gaussianMask)

UDVD -> MaskB: blur_dataset.py (sigma=14, normalize)
MaskB <- UDVD: atom_cluster_segment.py\n(same parameters as Pipeline A)\n→ 1742_udvd_incnb_XXXX_heavyblur_mask.png

ResB -> ResB: apply_cluster_filter.py\nmask_root=atom_cluster_out_udvd_sigma14_full,\npoints_template='{}_pos_Gen1-gaussianMask.txt',\n--dilate 15\n→ *_pos_gaussian_blur_*.txt\n+ *_origin_gaussian_blur_*.png

ResB -> GeoB: lattice_postprocess.py\nsuffix=lattice_filled2 / lattice_filled3\n(moderate lattice completion)
ResB -> GeoB: lattice_postprocess_dense.py\nsuffix=lattice_dense\n(very dense completion, for experiments)
@enduml
